# Required Testing

Jsons in this folder cover the various data types handled by this workflow, as detailed in the below table. 

Each PR to ReadsQC MUST come with successful jaws tests using the below jsons, in addition to any other relevant testing. Provide the jaws ids in a comment on your PR. If additional data types become available, you are REQUIRED TO ADD A TEST JSON to this folder. Beyond having a status of 'succeeded', you MUST MANUALLY CHECK that the output of these tests:
1) have a correctly annotated fastq, indicating which reads are 1 or 2 if they are non-interleaved
2) have correctly populated stats that match those existing in mongodb


